      "title_zh": "曼联的十号",
      "title_en": "Man United's number 10",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "最", "喜欢", "曼联", "的", "十", "号", "。", "我", "和", "朋友", "都", "爱", "他", "。"],
        ["他", "跑", "起来", "非常", "快", "，", "别人", "都", "跟", "不", "上", "他", "。"],
        ["今天", "晚上", "，", "他", "进", "了", "两", "个", "球", "！", "我们", "都", "站", "起来", "了", "。"],
        ["朋友", "问", "我", "：", "“", "你", "最", "喜欢", "哪", "个", "人", "？", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "还是", "十", "号", "！", "”"],
        ["明天", "我", "也", "要", "去", "跑", "一", "跑", "！", "我", "想", "跟", "他", "一样", "快", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "My favourite is Man United’s number 10. My friends and I all love him.",
        "When he runs he's really fast — nobody can keep up with him.",
        "This evening he scored two goals! We all jumped to our feet.",
        "My friend asked me: “Who’s your favourite?” I said: “Still number 10!”",
        "Tomorrow I’m going to go for a run too! I want to be as fast as him."
